WEBVTT

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:10.010
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:20.937
It's starting! It's starting!

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:14.759
I trust that Your Majesty
is in good health.

00:02:32.235 --> 00:02:34.320
You've already said your goodbyes,

00:02:34.404 --> 00:02:36.739
so why do you want me
to take your clothing out?

00:02:41.452 --> 00:02:43.788
Oh, my goodness.

00:02:43.872 --> 00:02:46.332
Good heaven! Confound it!

00:02:49.294 --> 00:02:50.503
All right.

00:02:50.587 --> 00:02:53.047
You go ahead. Go to Hanyang first.

00:02:53.673 --> 00:02:55.800
You… You mean alone? Why?

00:02:55.884 --> 00:02:57.468
Hey, fool, what do you think?

00:02:58.303 --> 00:02:59.721
That I came here for leisure?

00:02:59.804 --> 00:03:00.805
Can't you see?

00:03:01.723 --> 00:03:04.475
His Majesty sent me
to survey the construction site.

00:03:05.226 --> 00:03:07.353
And now I've wasted a whole day.

00:03:07.437 --> 00:03:09.189
I'm pretty busy as well, idiot.

00:03:09.272 --> 00:03:10.481
Go on. Go ahead.

00:03:12.192 --> 00:03:14.819
I just got to see Eun-sil.

00:03:23.912 --> 00:03:24.954
My lady.

00:03:27.207 --> 00:03:28.208
My lady.

00:03:33.963 --> 00:03:35.048
My lady.

00:03:36.216 --> 00:03:37.759
I've brought you a change of c…

00:03:38.343 --> 00:03:39.469
clothing.

00:03:40.595 --> 00:03:41.596
Wait.

00:03:41.679 --> 00:03:46.267
Oh, my lady.
But when did you find the time to change?

00:03:48.728 --> 00:03:49.729
Here.

00:03:50.855 --> 00:03:51.856
This is…

00:03:53.399 --> 00:03:54.901
How did you… Well…

00:03:56.319 --> 00:03:58.821
Where did you even find these garments?

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:02.867
You are… remarkably quick.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:06.371
There.

00:04:20.885 --> 00:04:22.011
My lady.

00:04:22.971 --> 00:04:24.764
Are you awake?

00:04:24.847 --> 00:04:26.516
Excuse me, I'm coming in.

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:29.936
All right.

00:04:33.815 --> 00:04:34.816
My lady?

00:04:35.316 --> 00:04:36.317
My lady!

00:04:41.197 --> 00:04:43.199
Since my husband's passing,

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.702
I have been burdened with shame and guilt

00:04:45.785 --> 00:04:48.288
that I did not immediately
follow after him.

00:04:50.039 --> 00:04:52.375
But now it seems the time has come.

00:04:53.293 --> 00:04:54.836
I shall leave rejoicing,

00:04:54.919 --> 00:04:58.298
because I know
I will see my husband again.

00:04:58.381 --> 00:04:59.382
Hui-yeon.

00:04:59.465 --> 00:05:01.175
May you remain in good health.

00:05:01.259 --> 00:05:02.510
Hui-yeon!

00:05:08.891 --> 00:05:13.730
It seems Hui-yeon has come
to see her brother for the last time.

00:05:14.772 --> 00:05:16.399
She has gone far away.

00:05:20.111 --> 00:05:21.112
Now listen.

00:05:21.195 --> 00:05:23.781
Search the riverbed and every single well

00:05:23.865 --> 00:05:26.951
and, if you must,
every single mountain within ten miles.

00:05:28.703 --> 00:05:30.872
But come back with Hui-yeon's remains.

00:05:30.955 --> 00:05:32.165
Yes, sir.

00:05:33.624 --> 00:05:37.211
Eun-sil, go right now
to see the Left State Councilor

00:05:37.295 --> 00:05:40.131
and tell him Hui-yeon
has passed away in dignity.

00:05:40.214 --> 00:05:42.925
-Yes. Y-Yes, sir.
-Oh, my goodness.

00:05:58.900 --> 00:05:59.901
My lord.

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:02.570
Yes? What is it you wish to say?

00:06:02.653 --> 00:06:05.198
The truth is, since that day I've known

00:06:05.281 --> 00:06:08.159
that taking one's own life
is an unpardonable sin.

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:12.288
Naturally, since God forbids
bringing harm to others,

00:06:13.247 --> 00:06:15.500
it's just as bad to do it to yourself.

00:06:18.461 --> 00:06:21.089
I felt I'd been given knowledge
I shouldn't have had.

00:06:22.799 --> 00:06:24.050
That scared me.

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:33.559
And what made it worse is
that circumstance is how we met.

00:06:34.977 --> 00:06:37.563
The same day you gain knowledge
you shouldn't have,

00:06:38.272 --> 00:06:40.483
you run into someone
you shouldn't have met.

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:50.159
Despite it all…

00:06:52.829 --> 00:06:54.705
I do love you very deeply.

00:07:15.476 --> 00:07:16.644
My lord!

00:07:17.979 --> 00:07:19.647
Have you had a pleasant journey?

00:07:20.398 --> 00:07:21.399
It's been a while.

00:07:21.899 --> 00:07:23.067
How have you been?

00:07:23.151 --> 00:07:26.154
Fine, fine. Well, good tidings to you.

00:07:46.591 --> 00:07:50.761
Young master! Oh, my! Young master!

00:07:51.345 --> 00:07:53.556
-Has all been well with you?
-Yes, sir.

00:07:54.056 --> 00:07:56.517
-Ah, I see.
-I'll be staying in the guest quarters.

00:07:56.601 --> 00:07:59.395
-Well, yes, quite so.
-You can let this person use my room.

00:08:00.688 --> 00:08:01.689
As you wish, sir,

00:08:01.772 --> 00:08:04.817
but you want me to put a servant
in a bedroom of your house?

00:08:04.901 --> 00:08:06.444
This person's not a servant.

00:08:07.153 --> 00:08:09.447
And there are reasons,
so let's get to it, shall we?

00:08:13.451 --> 00:08:14.869
This way, I'll show you.

00:08:33.137 --> 00:08:35.306
"Since reading the letter
in the tobacco box,

00:08:35.389 --> 00:08:38.643
I have been captivated
by your masculine charm, my lord."

00:08:39.143 --> 00:08:41.020
That is what the young widow said.

00:08:44.899 --> 00:08:46.192
Dear cousin,

00:08:46.275 --> 00:08:47.777
she is about to lie back.

00:08:48.277 --> 00:08:50.821
Her undergarments are within reach,
shall we say?

00:08:54.742 --> 00:08:57.245
That scent is so enchanting.

00:09:08.673 --> 00:09:11.592
Please wait here.
I shall go find the young lady.

00:09:11.676 --> 00:09:12.677
All right.

00:09:51.465 --> 00:09:53.718
"Filial piety and brotherly respect

00:09:54.468 --> 00:09:57.555
lead to kind and compassionate action."

00:09:58.556 --> 00:10:00.224
"Fine words," Confucius says.

00:10:01.517 --> 00:10:03.144
"Fine words and insinuations"…

00:10:03.227 --> 00:10:04.770
…"and insinuations are only rarely"…

00:10:04.854 --> 00:10:07.106
…"are only rarely associated with virtue."

00:10:08.357 --> 00:10:09.525
Concubine?

00:10:11.694 --> 00:10:13.904
How can that be?

00:10:26.709 --> 00:10:28.127
Look at this handwriting.

00:10:28.628 --> 00:10:29.712
Wretched girl.

00:10:35.343 --> 00:10:37.386
I should've been the one staying here.

00:10:42.224 --> 00:10:43.684
Oh, look at the clock.

00:10:43.768 --> 00:10:45.853
Crazy bitch broke it.

00:10:46.937 --> 00:10:48.064
Huh?

00:11:04.747 --> 00:11:06.040
Oh, my.

00:11:10.628 --> 00:11:12.004
Mother!

00:11:12.797 --> 00:11:15.549
Yes? Oh, you've come.

00:11:16.842 --> 00:11:18.219
Did you find something?

00:11:19.637 --> 00:11:23.224
I went to So-ok's room,
and I found this there.

00:11:24.642 --> 00:11:25.976
Go on, read it to me then.

00:11:26.644 --> 00:11:28.938
I'm drowsy. I can't keep my eyes open.

00:11:31.899 --> 00:11:33.150
-Mmm.
-Uh…

00:11:38.447 --> 00:11:42.618
"Young master,
I'm not sure you'll believe me.

00:11:42.702 --> 00:11:45.871
It takes my breath away to think of you,
young master.

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:50.459
It makes me wet to imagine you,
and I quiver all night in my bed.

00:11:52.086 --> 00:11:53.170
My legs…

00:11:53.963 --> 00:11:56.382
keep spreading apart constantly,

00:11:56.465 --> 00:11:58.884
and I have no thick hands to unravel me.

00:11:59.385 --> 00:12:01.095
I miss you so much, young master."

00:12:06.851 --> 00:12:08.144
You may leave now.

00:12:09.353 --> 00:12:11.480
You may leave now. Quickly! Quickly!

00:12:19.447 --> 00:12:20.698
Wait. What's this?

00:12:23.159 --> 00:12:26.454
Did you really find this
among So-ok's things?

00:12:26.537 --> 00:12:28.581
Yes, Mother.

00:12:29.415 --> 00:12:31.041
Then I just can't think why…

00:12:31.125 --> 00:12:32.126
Why?

00:12:34.128 --> 00:12:35.296
"Young master."

00:12:36.464 --> 00:12:38.549
"Young master"? "Young master"? My!

00:12:38.632 --> 00:12:41.594
So-ok, you little minx.

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:46.390
I guess she must playact with his lord,
calling him a name of young master.

00:12:46.474 --> 00:12:48.934
Pardon me? Oh-Oh, surely not.

00:12:49.018 --> 00:12:50.478
What do you mean, "surely not"?

00:12:50.978 --> 00:12:52.897
What do you mean, "surely not"?

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:54.482
Then what do you think So-ok…

00:12:56.442 --> 00:12:57.443
Oh, my.

00:12:58.486 --> 00:13:01.447
It's, uh, not that.

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:03.699
-Oh. Oh, Mother!
-Please. That wench.

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:07.328
After I sent her
to serve as his concubine!

00:13:08.287 --> 00:13:09.622
Oh.

00:13:22.718 --> 00:13:23.719
Oh.

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:27.807
Are you going out?

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:30.184
To see my brother-in-law
at Janganmun Gate.

00:13:32.436 --> 00:13:33.896
Look after her well.

00:13:33.979 --> 00:13:35.856
She may be tired from that long journey.

00:13:36.357 --> 00:13:39.443
You know, you're the only one
in whom I can really trust.

00:13:40.361 --> 00:13:41.362
Yes, sir.

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:45.741
Have a safe trip.

00:13:46.242 --> 00:13:49.203
Everything in the letter I sent
the day before was a lie and a joke.

00:13:49.286 --> 00:13:51.205
"Everything was a lie and a joke."

00:13:51.705 --> 00:13:53.958
-"Everything was a lie."
-I was reminded of the feelings

00:13:54.041 --> 00:13:55.793
I once harbored for Lord Cho Won,

00:13:55.876 --> 00:13:57.837
so I teased him as a jape.

00:13:58.629 --> 00:14:02.967
I pray you take my letter in good spirit
and pay it little mind.

00:14:03.467 --> 00:14:05.511
I pray you do not trouble your heart.

00:14:05.594 --> 00:14:08.055
And I humbly beg
your gracious forgiveness.

00:14:10.933 --> 00:14:13.936
"Everything I wrote as a joke and a lie."

00:14:16.021 --> 00:14:17.898
"Feelings I once harbored."

00:14:19.441 --> 00:14:20.526
Let us through!

00:14:20.609 --> 00:14:22.820
For goodness' sake,
there's too much to do right now.

00:14:22.903 --> 00:14:26.031
Goodness.

00:14:27.199 --> 00:14:30.619
The 60th birthday banquet
for Her Royal Highness requires men.

00:14:30.703 --> 00:14:32.288
The palace will send people,

00:14:32.371 --> 00:14:34.915
but there is much to do
to prepare the work.

00:14:34.999 --> 00:14:36.709
You've made a good point,

00:14:36.792 --> 00:14:39.753
but construction is advancing
faster than anticipated.

00:14:39.837 --> 00:14:44.049
If we were to needlessly reassign people
while the work is coming along so well,

00:14:44.133 --> 00:14:46.176
this would surely invite complaints.

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:47.803
That won't happen with me.

00:14:47.887 --> 00:14:50.264
That's what I'm trying to prevent
with my plan.

00:14:53.559 --> 00:14:58.105
I think this is precisely the way
to see this project through to the end.

00:15:00.357 --> 00:15:01.650
Come this way, will you?

00:15:01.734 --> 00:15:04.069
-Well, I guess it's all rather…
-I thought at last we could…

00:15:04.153 --> 00:15:05.362
-Brother-in-law.
-Could what?

00:15:06.655 --> 00:15:09.992
You're very busy now, I see,
so I shall take my leave.

00:15:12.453 --> 00:15:13.954
I hope you will forgive me.

00:15:14.788 --> 00:15:17.458
The matter's quite serious,
and we have much to deliberate.

00:15:18.667 --> 00:15:20.836
Oh. Come to my quarters later.

00:15:22.171 --> 00:15:25.549
A good chance to speak ill of your cousin
in her absence, don't you think?

00:15:27.051 --> 00:15:28.052
All right then.

00:15:32.348 --> 00:15:35.559
Of course. I can confirm that right away.

00:15:39.313 --> 00:15:42.399
We have now furnished all the paper,
as arranged.

00:15:42.983 --> 00:15:44.902
How shall I ever repay such a favor?

00:15:46.445 --> 00:15:51.450
His Majesty's kindness
is no favor to be repaid.

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:55.329
All of Hwaseong is its beneficiary.

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:57.581
Yes, sir.

00:15:58.791 --> 00:16:00.876
Ah, what are you doing? Hurry it up!

00:16:01.835 --> 00:16:04.088
Do you think we have a week
to move one rock?

00:16:34.576 --> 00:16:36.245
My lady, it is I.

00:16:37.413 --> 00:16:38.497
May I enter?

00:17:00.436 --> 00:17:01.562
Have you been crying?

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:05.858
Do you have regrets?

00:17:06.483 --> 00:17:08.318
No, I chose to act as I did.

00:17:08.402 --> 00:17:09.695
What could I possibly regret?

00:17:09.778 --> 00:17:11.405
Then what is troubling you?

00:17:14.575 --> 00:17:17.453
It was written that everything
was a lie and a joke.

00:17:18.454 --> 00:17:20.414
I could tell something was amiss.

00:17:21.331 --> 00:17:22.499
Still and all,

00:17:23.834 --> 00:17:26.086
if you are only toying with me…

00:17:29.506 --> 00:17:32.509
-If that's all this comes to--
-In my haste to escort you without delay,

00:17:32.593 --> 00:17:34.928
I had completely forgotten
about that letter.

00:17:35.012 --> 00:17:36.388
My apologies, my lady.

00:17:36.472 --> 00:17:37.639
You're in such distress.

00:17:37.723 --> 00:17:39.933
You should've come
to see me about it sooner.

00:17:41.935 --> 00:17:43.937
You read the previous letter,
have you not?

00:17:49.151 --> 00:17:50.903
There was another letter, you mean?

00:17:51.695 --> 00:17:52.696
What?

00:18:05.793 --> 00:18:09.129
It would seem you have passed
that letter along to the young widow.

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:12.007
I am moved to tears
by your deep consideration,

00:18:12.091 --> 00:18:14.218
handing the young widow over to me

00:18:14.301 --> 00:18:16.845
so that I may reap the reward,
dear cousin.

00:18:21.183 --> 00:18:23.185
Well, it's come to this,

00:18:23.769 --> 00:18:26.230
so I ought to begin with the first letter.

00:18:28.398 --> 00:18:30.859
The story I'm going to recount
is rather intricate.

00:18:31.443 --> 00:18:35.447
So I beg you, please make sure
your heart is prepared, my lady.

00:18:41.036 --> 00:18:43.664
There was a time
when I roamed the provinces of Joseon,

00:18:43.747 --> 00:18:45.040
writing of tobacco.

00:18:47.709 --> 00:18:52.339
I met a tobacco merchant during that time
who was well-versed on the subject.

00:18:53.549 --> 00:18:55.634
She said she could be of assistance.

00:18:57.845 --> 00:18:59.888
When I was intoxicated
by the taste of tobacco,

00:18:59.972 --> 00:19:01.723
my mind was in a haze,

00:19:01.807 --> 00:19:04.685
her lustful appetite for me
was made very plain.

00:19:04.768 --> 00:19:07.146
Indeed, one day she went so far…

00:19:09.189 --> 00:19:11.316
…as to demand my attentions.

00:19:14.736 --> 00:19:18.073
Not wishing to appear unmanly,
I feigned bravado.

00:19:20.576 --> 00:19:22.369
And by the end, I acceded to…

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:26.248
to her lascivious and unspeakable
demands of me.

00:19:44.558 --> 00:19:45.601
However…

00:19:48.437 --> 00:19:53.233
just as the heat of summer falls quickly
from the red and brown autumn leaves,

00:19:53.317 --> 00:19:55.527
my wandering period came to an end.

00:19:55.611 --> 00:19:57.946
And I believe the time I spent
with that woman

00:19:58.030 --> 00:20:00.866
has faded
before it could become a scandal.

00:20:00.949 --> 00:20:02.034
And, alas,

00:20:03.035 --> 00:20:06.663
having somehow found where I reside,
she recently sent me a letter.

00:20:10.542 --> 00:20:12.794
And in that letter that she wrote to me…

00:20:14.922 --> 00:20:18.800
she told me how she still lusted for me
in language so indecent.

00:20:21.553 --> 00:20:23.013
I did not deign to answer.

00:20:24.264 --> 00:20:26.183
Indeed, I intended to burn it,

00:20:26.266 --> 00:20:28.060
but through my negligence,

00:20:28.143 --> 00:20:31.355
it was mixed with my other letters
and found its way to you.

00:20:34.191 --> 00:20:35.943
I was so ashamed and dismayed.

00:20:36.985 --> 00:20:40.030
I had no idea of the proper way
to handle this matter.

00:20:40.113 --> 00:20:42.324
So I went and sought her out

00:20:43.158 --> 00:20:46.119
and beseeched her to write
that every word of that letter

00:20:46.203 --> 00:20:48.997
was nothing but a lie and a bad joke.

00:20:49.581 --> 00:20:51.083
I begged her on my knees.

00:20:53.919 --> 00:20:55.420
How could you with her kind?

00:20:55.504 --> 00:20:57.923
Because what I feel for you, my lady…

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:05.222
…is truer than ever it was,

00:21:06.223 --> 00:21:10.435
and more sincere than anything
I've felt in my whole life.

00:21:18.277 --> 00:21:19.569
It'll all be all right.

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:24.116
Now that you've told it all to me…

00:21:27.452 --> 00:21:30.539
that horrible emptiness in your heart
shall be filled.

00:21:32.624 --> 00:21:33.750
I can fill it.

00:21:41.883 --> 00:21:43.969
This wretched past of mine…

00:21:45.345 --> 00:21:47.431
These most shameful days I have lived,

00:21:47.514 --> 00:21:50.017
and that have torn
your poor heart asunder…

00:21:54.229 --> 00:21:57.524
How shall I ever express it
to you, my lady,

00:21:58.734 --> 00:22:01.361
this self-punishment that I desire so?

00:22:31.808 --> 00:22:33.352
It will all be all right.

00:22:44.196 --> 00:22:46.114
I am so grateful, my lady.

00:22:49.326 --> 00:22:50.827
My lady!

00:22:51.328 --> 00:22:54.373
What am I to do with this? Oh, woe is me!

00:22:54.456 --> 00:22:59.169
What am I to do
with this wretched past of mine?

00:22:59.252 --> 00:23:00.796
Oh, wretched me!

00:23:09.304 --> 00:23:11.098
How might you ever…

00:23:13.266 --> 00:23:14.267
truly…

00:23:15.644 --> 00:23:19.231
forgive me for my wretched past?

00:23:19.731 --> 00:23:22.025
How could you ever respect ever again?

00:23:22.109 --> 00:23:25.195
I gave the young widow some flowers,
and she smiled a little.

00:23:26.238 --> 00:23:29.408
Mrs. Asan taught her how to make hwajeon,
and she made some.

00:23:30.283 --> 00:23:33.495
And she told me that although the wind
may carry the fragrance away,

00:23:33.578 --> 00:23:35.455
yet it shall linger in her heart.

00:23:36.039 --> 00:23:39.376
And so I should gather some flowers again
around this time next year.

00:23:40.335 --> 00:23:43.922
So hooray for spring, you say?

00:23:45.549 --> 00:23:49.177
So you intend to stay until next spring,
when the brooks have thawed?

00:23:52.973 --> 00:23:54.683
Oh, dear.

00:23:55.851 --> 00:23:58.353
So you do not intend to die.

00:24:00.856 --> 00:24:02.649
You want to go on living?

00:24:05.694 --> 00:24:08.572
The young widow wishes
to continue living, I see.

00:24:38.143 --> 00:24:40.270
Did you say she came back alone?

00:24:44.191 --> 00:24:46.359
Oh, dear. What's happened?

00:24:46.443 --> 00:24:48.069
-What?
-Oh, my.

00:24:48.570 --> 00:24:50.489
-What has happened?
-Madam.

00:24:52.032 --> 00:24:56.620
My lady has passed away to the afterlife.

00:24:56.703 --> 00:24:58.163
Oh.

00:24:58.246 --> 00:25:01.625
Oh, my lord.

00:25:11.843 --> 00:25:13.011
My lady.

00:25:13.512 --> 00:25:16.765
Is there something troubling
in your heart today?

00:25:16.848 --> 00:25:18.558
Now, why would you ask me that?

00:25:18.642 --> 00:25:22.562
Well, there's a bit of anger
in the flowers that you're painting.

00:25:25.607 --> 00:25:26.733
Oh, that wit.

00:25:26.816 --> 00:25:29.444
I wonder which of your parents
bequeathed you that.

00:25:31.029 --> 00:25:32.864
Madam! It's Gye-hwa!

00:25:32.948 --> 00:25:34.908
I have something urgent to tell you.

00:25:39.746 --> 00:25:42.749
I have news about the Left State
Councilor's daughter-in-law's servant.

00:25:42.832 --> 00:25:45.752
I'm told she has returned, but alone.

00:25:48.463 --> 00:25:50.298
That was to be expected.

00:25:52.092 --> 00:25:55.720
Tomorrow at sunrise, I shall call upon
the Lady of the First Rank.

00:25:55.804 --> 00:25:57.305
Yes. I'll get everything ready.

00:26:04.104 --> 00:26:05.730
All right, let's go.

00:26:08.692 --> 00:26:11.403
I get the impression you're very unwell.

00:26:11.486 --> 00:26:13.572
Is that the impression you get?

00:26:14.239 --> 00:26:15.490
Yes.

00:26:16.074 --> 00:26:19.244
My daughter-in-law's household
has sent word to me today.

00:26:21.079 --> 00:26:22.372
It would appear,

00:26:23.957 --> 00:26:27.043
she has breathed her last
while staying in their house.

00:26:29.671 --> 00:26:31.548
What?

00:26:32.799 --> 00:26:34.217
Am I understanding you?

00:26:34.759 --> 00:26:36.720
Your daughter-in-law has passed on?

00:26:37.762 --> 00:26:40.849
He will no longer be lonely, my Geum-ho.

00:26:42.100 --> 00:26:45.061
I can take solace in that.

00:26:45.854 --> 00:26:47.022
Although,

00:26:48.023 --> 00:26:51.318
whether she purposely threw herself
into a river

00:26:51.860 --> 00:26:54.029
or into a well, I cannot know.

00:26:56.865 --> 00:26:59.701
Her body has not yet been found.

00:27:01.369 --> 00:27:02.912
Good heavens.

00:27:03.496 --> 00:27:05.624
I can't begin to imagine the…

00:27:06.499 --> 00:27:08.501
the pain that you must be in.

00:27:10.211 --> 00:27:13.089
Having shared fellowship
with your daughter-in-law,

00:27:13.173 --> 00:27:16.593
I, too, am in a state of grief and pain.

00:27:17.761 --> 00:27:21.973
But I cannot fathom how much sorrow
her death has caused your family.

00:27:32.233 --> 00:27:33.401
Thank you, I…

00:27:34.819 --> 00:27:35.820
My lady,

00:27:37.030 --> 00:27:38.657
if I may be so bold,

00:27:39.407 --> 00:27:41.951
there is one thing you could do
if you wish to help me.

00:27:42.035 --> 00:27:44.412
Yes. I'd be happy to.

00:27:44.913 --> 00:27:45.997
Please tell me how.

00:27:46.081 --> 00:27:48.625
Surely a virtuous lady such as yourself

00:27:49.626 --> 00:27:52.420
could present a petition
to His Majesty, should…

00:27:52.921 --> 00:27:56.132
should any ungracious gossip get around.

00:27:59.094 --> 00:28:00.095
That is, I--

00:28:00.178 --> 00:28:04.516
Couldn't Lord Yoo be of any assistance
to you in this matter?

00:28:15.610 --> 00:28:16.611
Yes.

00:28:17.570 --> 00:28:19.197
I shall see to the matter.

00:28:40.260 --> 00:28:43.346
"Surely a virtuous lady such as yourself

00:28:43.430 --> 00:28:46.891
could present a petition to His Majesty."

00:28:50.562 --> 00:28:52.897
"My lady."

00:28:56.025 --> 00:28:58.653
Whoever thought one day
you'd entreat me like that?

00:29:10.248 --> 00:29:12.250
-So-ok.
-Yes, my lady?

00:29:12.333 --> 00:29:14.002
I won't be gone for very long.

00:29:14.085 --> 00:29:16.421
Please do nothing to invite gossip
while I'm away.

00:29:16.504 --> 00:29:18.173
I understand, my lady.

00:29:18.256 --> 00:29:19.340
Safe journey.

00:29:20.425 --> 00:29:22.218
All right.

00:29:23.928 --> 00:29:24.929
Let's go.

00:29:28.349 --> 00:29:32.061
All right, come on, come on.
Hurry. We must finish before sundown.

00:29:32.145 --> 00:29:33.938
Hmm?

00:29:39.194 --> 00:29:41.571
There is something I must tell you.

00:29:41.654 --> 00:29:43.698
Pray come. I need you here.

00:29:44.741 --> 00:29:46.993
I shall wait for you
at the study annex all night.

00:29:47.076 --> 00:29:48.161
"Pray come."

00:29:51.790 --> 00:29:54.501
-Hey! You wretch.
-Oh, you startled me! Who… Who are you?

00:29:54.584 --> 00:29:56.586
-Be quiet. Quiet. Quiet, quiet.
-Mom?

00:29:59.047 --> 00:30:01.007
In here. Come on, get inside.

00:30:02.550 --> 00:30:04.469
Goodness' sake.

00:30:07.972 --> 00:30:08.973
This love letter.

00:30:09.057 --> 00:30:11.100
You were going to give it
to the young master?

00:30:12.018 --> 00:30:14.896
-Yes.
-You crazy little…

00:30:14.979 --> 00:30:16.773
For heaven's sake!

00:30:16.856 --> 00:30:19.234
My lady gave me her permission of course.

00:30:19.317 --> 00:30:22.320
Mother, what would you know
about the life of a Bukchon lady?

00:30:22.403 --> 00:30:23.988
What is the meaning of that?

00:30:24.489 --> 00:30:25.949
Whose permission did you get?

00:30:26.533 --> 00:30:27.826
Your lady's?

00:30:28.868 --> 00:30:30.328
Y-Y-Your lady…

00:30:31.788 --> 00:30:33.164
Then do you mean to say

00:30:33.248 --> 00:30:35.416
the lady of this house
is apprised of what's happened?

00:30:35.500 --> 00:30:37.377
Yes, Mother, that's what I'm saying.

00:30:37.460 --> 00:30:40.213
She also said that
it was quite all right with her.

00:30:40.296 --> 00:30:44.092
Oh, and she also said that Lord Cho Won
would be of great service to me

00:30:44.175 --> 00:30:47.178
and that I should go beseech him
to lend his assistance.

00:30:47.262 --> 00:30:48.596
Now can't you tell?

00:30:48.680 --> 00:30:51.891
There's no way
I could have made that line up alone.

00:30:53.059 --> 00:30:54.185
Lord Cho Won…

00:30:55.019 --> 00:30:57.939
Don't you think I know
what is worrying you, Mother?

00:30:58.022 --> 00:30:59.190
Of course I do.

00:30:59.691 --> 00:31:01.901
There's nothing to worry about at all.

00:31:02.527 --> 00:31:06.114
You know, my lady and all the domestics
who work in this house,

00:31:06.698 --> 00:31:09.701
they do not regard me
as merely a child-bearer.

00:31:10.994 --> 00:31:13.121
Mother, are you listening to me or not?

00:31:13.204 --> 00:31:14.372
Hush, you wretch.

00:31:18.960 --> 00:31:23.256
And you wrote this love letter
with Lord Cho Won?

00:31:23.756 --> 00:31:25.300
Well, I told you I did, so…

00:31:28.678 --> 00:31:32.432
Oh, could it be you know Lord Cho Won too?

00:31:32.515 --> 00:31:35.435
So-ok. Tell me plainly…

00:31:37.312 --> 00:31:39.898
other than being schooled
in writing by that lord,

00:31:40.481 --> 00:31:43.651
did something else… Did anything happen
when you were together?

00:31:45.278 --> 00:31:47.030
What do you imagine we'd do?

00:31:47.614 --> 00:31:50.450
Tell me the truth.
Nothing happened, really?

00:31:51.034 --> 00:31:52.702
I told you. Nothing.

00:31:55.455 --> 00:31:56.456
Huh?

00:31:57.498 --> 00:31:58.541
Hmm…

00:32:09.928 --> 00:32:13.932
Then I suppose you never noticed the mark
in the shape of a tiger on his chest?

00:32:15.934 --> 00:32:17.310
Oh, does he have one?

00:32:18.353 --> 00:32:20.521
Damn! I was the only one
without my clothes.

00:32:20.605 --> 00:32:22.982
He never removed his garments,
so I saw nothing.

00:32:23.066 --> 00:32:25.151
You…

00:32:30.949 --> 00:32:34.160
Actually, now that I think about it,
I was in my undergarments.

00:32:38.915 --> 00:32:40.041
Oh, I forgot.

00:32:41.084 --> 00:32:42.418
What did you forget?

00:32:42.502 --> 00:32:44.462
Could there possibly be something else?

00:32:45.046 --> 00:32:46.673
-Mm-hmm.
-Seriously, you little--

00:32:46.756 --> 00:32:48.466
Hey! It's not about me.

00:32:48.549 --> 00:32:50.385
It's just something I heard.

00:32:52.720 --> 00:32:56.891
I overheard when they were
in the lady's room whispering.

00:32:57.392 --> 00:32:58.851
They said the Left State Councilor's

00:32:58.935 --> 00:33:01.938
daughter-in-law's maidservant
came back alone in secret.

00:33:03.398 --> 00:33:06.359
Of course, I don't know
what their true intentions were,

00:33:06.442 --> 00:33:08.987
but I heard
what the servant girls were saying.

00:33:09.070 --> 00:33:10.989
The daughter-in-law
who was supposed to be dead

00:33:11.072 --> 00:33:14.409
might instead have skipped out
and fled by the light of the moon.

00:33:23.334 --> 00:33:25.211
Fled by the light of the moon?

00:33:26.838 --> 00:33:29.298
Eun-sil!

00:33:32.176 --> 00:33:33.177
Go on ahead.

00:33:36.931 --> 00:33:39.600
I know how sad you are
the lady you served has passed,

00:33:39.684 --> 00:33:41.102
but that's enough now.

00:33:47.608 --> 00:33:50.778
This family indeed
is greatly honored by this.

00:33:51.279 --> 00:33:54.657
But unless you can stop your crying,
you'll be the object of disdain.

00:33:54.741 --> 00:33:56.868
So then, what can I do?

00:33:58.953 --> 00:34:00.621
Now that my lady's gone,

00:34:01.414 --> 00:34:03.624
I know I won't be treated better
than a dog.

00:34:06.669 --> 00:34:07.879
I have no idea.

00:34:09.255 --> 00:34:12.258
Hey, stop weeping
or you'll earn their reproach.

00:34:14.177 --> 00:34:16.846
Go see what's happening beyond the gate.

00:34:18.973 --> 00:34:20.892
What was it, Chil-seong? Pal-seong?

00:34:21.392 --> 00:34:24.395
The servant of the lord
who stayed at the annex is waiting there.

00:34:24.479 --> 00:34:26.105
I was going to chase him away,

00:34:26.189 --> 00:34:28.149
but I felt sorry for you,
so I'm telling you.

00:34:29.484 --> 00:34:31.694
-Did you say he's called Chil-seong?
-Mmm.

00:34:36.616 --> 00:34:37.658
Oh, dear.

00:34:45.083 --> 00:34:46.292
How are you?

00:34:46.375 --> 00:34:48.252
Heavens, you're so pale and thin.

00:34:55.093 --> 00:34:59.680
I heard the lady you served
has passed away.

00:35:01.891 --> 00:35:04.644
This is beef. Dried beef.

00:35:05.144 --> 00:35:06.145
Here.

00:35:08.731 --> 00:35:10.858
You must eat well,
despite the grief you taste.

00:35:11.359 --> 00:35:13.903
The living must go on… must go on living.

00:35:15.988 --> 00:35:17.532
It wasn't easy obtaining this,

00:35:18.157 --> 00:35:19.283
so I hope you enjoy it.

00:36:16.465 --> 00:36:17.842
Young master!

00:36:17.925 --> 00:36:20.261
Young master, you have a visitor.

00:36:29.145 --> 00:36:32.064
Well now, how is it that you come
without a word of warning?

00:36:33.316 --> 00:36:34.400
Could it be…

00:36:36.152 --> 00:36:38.905
that you have decided to reward me today?

00:36:39.530 --> 00:36:41.574
There is something we must discuss.

00:36:49.624 --> 00:36:50.750
Dear cousin.

00:36:52.376 --> 00:36:53.544
Pray speak.

00:36:56.047 --> 00:36:57.423
All Bukchon is reeling

00:36:57.924 --> 00:37:00.092
because they all think
that she's passed away.

00:37:00.676 --> 00:37:01.969
That's how it should be.

00:37:03.262 --> 00:37:06.641
And now that's put a noose
around both of our necks, I must say.

00:37:09.352 --> 00:37:11.062
Well, I'll be.

00:37:11.812 --> 00:37:13.564
Things are getting interesting.

00:37:13.648 --> 00:37:14.857
Won, listen.

00:37:15.358 --> 00:37:16.484
You must stop this now.

00:37:17.068 --> 00:37:18.819
Just put it back the way it was.

00:37:20.029 --> 00:37:21.364
Surely you don't mean…

00:37:23.866 --> 00:37:25.952
You want to put an end to our bet?

00:37:27.620 --> 00:37:28.621
But why?

00:37:29.497 --> 00:37:31.457
What a preposterous proposition.

00:37:32.583 --> 00:37:35.586
If we continue,
if we let this wager go on,

00:37:35.670 --> 00:37:38.130
our family's reputation could fall
along with your honor.

00:37:40.383 --> 00:37:41.509
With my honor?

00:37:42.760 --> 00:37:43.761
Huh?

00:37:44.595 --> 00:37:45.888
You said my honor?

00:37:48.599 --> 00:37:50.059
Oh, cousin.

00:37:50.643 --> 00:37:52.770
Are you truly concerned over my honor?

00:37:54.355 --> 00:37:56.440
From the beginning of our correspondence,

00:37:57.858 --> 00:38:00.736
all I've done
was according to your wishes.

00:38:00.820 --> 00:38:03.406
Though I longed
to show the world my independence

00:38:03.990 --> 00:38:05.866
after failing so miserably.

00:38:06.450 --> 00:38:09.578
Well, I began to think that I could
never do anything against your wishes,

00:38:09.662 --> 00:38:10.955
as long as I live.

00:38:11.539 --> 00:38:12.790
The bet stands.

00:38:17.420 --> 00:38:19.797
And let the chips fall where they may.

00:39:48.469 --> 00:39:50.054
All right then, you wait here.

00:39:51.013 --> 00:39:52.014
Yes, ma'am.

00:40:09.573 --> 00:40:10.658
Miss Yun?

00:40:15.955 --> 00:40:17.957
Is that really you, Miss Yun?

00:40:26.340 --> 00:40:28.384
It has been much too long.

00:40:29.969 --> 00:40:33.848
You're quite right, it has, Mrs. Asan.

00:41:33.115 --> 00:41:34.116
My lady?

00:41:41.332 --> 00:41:42.625
My lady, it is you.

00:41:48.088 --> 00:41:50.216
I thought you would
never be with me again.

00:41:56.639 --> 00:41:59.058
Is this really how you're living now?

00:42:06.774 --> 00:42:09.527
How could you be so imprudent, my dear?

00:42:11.779 --> 00:42:13.531
I am so very ashamed.

00:42:13.614 --> 00:42:17.034
If you had come to me,
if you had just explained, I…

00:42:17.993 --> 00:42:21.372
I thought you were really gone
without saying goodbye,

00:42:21.455 --> 00:42:23.249
just disappeared without a word.

00:42:23.332 --> 00:42:26.877
How are they bearing up,
my father-in-law and mother-in-law?

00:42:28.879 --> 00:42:31.590
All of those in Bukchon
think that you have died.

00:42:32.299 --> 00:42:33.926
They all believe it was suicide.

00:42:35.135 --> 00:42:37.304
You can never go back there again.

00:42:38.222 --> 00:42:39.807
There is no going back.

00:42:40.349 --> 00:42:43.727
What on earth
did you want to achieve by this act?

00:42:48.107 --> 00:42:52.194
Did my dear cousin bring you here,
my lady?

00:42:53.529 --> 00:42:55.030
I decided to come.

00:42:56.156 --> 00:42:58.534
It was my choice
to follow the lord and come here.

00:42:59.326 --> 00:43:00.744
For just a little while,

00:43:02.121 --> 00:43:04.873
I wished to remain by his side

00:43:06.125 --> 00:43:08.002
as any ordinary woman might.

00:43:34.278 --> 00:43:36.363
How I envy your resolve, my lady.

00:43:40.159 --> 00:43:41.827
I wish I could be so…

00:43:45.331 --> 00:43:48.083
I wish I could be more like you, I guess.

00:43:52.963 --> 00:43:53.964
I…

00:43:58.802 --> 00:44:01.263
Hui-yeon is who I'd most like to be.

00:44:18.405 --> 00:44:19.740
As a girl,

00:44:19.823 --> 00:44:22.201
I learned proper writing skills
from my father.

00:44:22.910 --> 00:44:26.121
I can imitate his writing now perfectly.

00:44:33.837 --> 00:44:35.798
My lady, what is that?

00:44:42.054 --> 00:44:44.473
"The Cheongyu Cho clan's scion, Won,

00:44:45.140 --> 00:44:47.851
and your esteemed daughter,
Lady An Hui-yeon,

00:44:47.935 --> 00:44:50.562
seek to form an honorable match and bond.

00:44:51.146 --> 00:44:52.940
I humbly make this request

00:44:53.774 --> 00:44:57.152
and await your consent, as is customary."

00:45:05.703 --> 00:45:07.871
I am only his cousin, you see.

00:45:08.706 --> 00:45:10.791
I can't consent on my own to this.

00:45:16.088 --> 00:45:17.715
Madam, I… I'm not…

00:45:18.799 --> 00:45:20.551
You said that you wished

00:45:21.093 --> 00:45:23.470
to remain with my cousin
as an ordinary woman,

00:45:23.554 --> 00:45:24.930
no matter how short or long.

00:45:27.558 --> 00:45:28.767
Then do so.

00:45:29.977 --> 00:45:31.061
Then you…

00:45:33.689 --> 00:45:35.566
may pass away with grace and honor.

00:45:38.360 --> 00:45:42.531
You must follow the destiny
which has been placed before you.

00:45:43.240 --> 00:45:45.617
That's the only way to make amends,

00:45:45.701 --> 00:45:48.996
to honor a woman who will,
for as long as she still draws breath,

00:45:49.580 --> 00:45:51.623
never be called by her own name.

00:45:52.207 --> 00:45:53.917
It's important you're aware.

00:45:54.543 --> 00:45:56.462
My lady, I'm doing this for you.

00:46:24.948 --> 00:46:26.366
Of course I'm aware.

00:46:31.955 --> 00:46:34.583
Though I may call myself honorable
no longer…

00:46:38.295 --> 00:46:41.590
I shall seek atonement
through death in the end, I know.

00:46:46.553 --> 00:46:48.013
Do one thing for me.

00:46:48.096 --> 00:46:49.848
But of course, tell me what.

00:46:50.432 --> 00:46:53.644
The letters my lord and I exchanged
are in my room somewhere.

00:46:53.727 --> 00:46:55.395
I should've burned them long ago.

00:46:55.479 --> 00:46:57.981
I could not bring myself to,
so I left them there.

00:47:01.527 --> 00:47:02.861
I only wished…

00:47:05.489 --> 00:47:07.741
I could long for him just a bit longer.

00:47:12.454 --> 00:47:14.206
Do not be concerned.

00:47:17.501 --> 00:47:20.462
I'll take care. I shall see to all this.

00:47:30.055 --> 00:47:31.890
My lady, as you go,

00:47:33.016 --> 00:47:36.144
all you need to do
is put remorse behind you forever

00:47:37.563 --> 00:47:40.399
and live out your days
to your heart's content…

00:47:42.901 --> 00:47:45.237
in the company of my dear cousin.

00:47:47.239 --> 00:47:49.032
Pray, do just that.

00:48:09.094 --> 00:48:10.345
Young master.

00:48:11.680 --> 00:48:12.764
You are late.

00:48:12.848 --> 00:48:15.976
My cousin, has she departed yet?

00:48:16.476 --> 00:48:18.520
Yes. She left already,

00:48:19.187 --> 00:48:22.232
right after she saw the guest
in the room across the way.

00:48:53.555 --> 00:48:55.682
My Lady Cho wrote it for you and me.

00:49:19.414 --> 00:49:21.291
I wish to remain by your side.

00:49:30.968 --> 00:49:32.052
Come, come.

00:49:39.601 --> 00:49:41.478
We've scorned duty and decency.

00:49:42.187 --> 00:49:44.189
Yet, I don't care what others think.

00:49:44.773 --> 00:49:47.401
Pray, say those words back to me.

00:49:52.280 --> 00:49:55.075
I, too, wish to remain by your side,
my lady.

00:50:04.835 --> 00:50:06.628
I don't care what people think.